[{"title":"拟洪武宫词十二首 其九","author":"黄省曾","text":"清萱到处碧鬖鬖，兴庆宫前色倍含。\n借问皇家何种此，太平天子要宜男。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18232,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟洪武宫词十二首 其十","author":"黄省曾","text":"九五飞龙宝殿高，朝回常倚赭黄袍。\n星祥一过天王目，长夜经纶不厌劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18233,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟洪武宫词十二首 其十一","author":"黄省曾","text":"长春门里清明日，上苑兰风花鸟繁。\n焚却纸钱啼泣罢，又随龙辇向西园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18234,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟洪武宫词十二首 其十二","author":"黄省曾","text":"金铺日月门将启，诸院争先画翠娥。\n高髻纱笼向何处，六龙床上看皇哥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18235,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古诗（六首。永乐五年） 其一","author":"高煦","text":"三五肇人极，圣道何巍巍。\n夏殷逮成周，文风渐弘开。\n吕政绝天纪，残苛恣雄猜。\n万姓坐涂炭，六籍成寒灰。\n自谓世无敌，沙丘忽崩摧。\n阿房乐未央，长城空怨堆。\n人文至今存，狂秦安在哉？\n千古骊山下，秽德衔余哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古诗（六首。永乐五年） 其二","author":"高煦","text":"武皇藉文景，民殷仓粟陈。\n不守清净化，开边政多门。\n四方屡游幸，万里行三军。\n有子不自保，哀哉真少恩。\n外虚仁义名，奈兹多欲身。\n神仙在何处，茂陵今几春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18237,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古诗（六首。永乐五年） 其三","author":"高煦","text":"自古寺人职，司阍供洒扫。\n秦汉始挠政，国本亦枯槁。\n唐初任犹轻，高贵在天宝。\n沦胥宣懿间，神器由颠倒。\n门生诋天子，尊重压元老。\n社稷遂已墟，群阉那自保。\n全忠不堪忿，歼殒何草草。\n嗟哉太宗业，家奴坏王道。\n后世宜鉴之，虑患防须早。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18238,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古诗（六首。永乐五年） 其四","author":"高煦","text":"道君莅天位，聪明迈前人。\n绍述溺新法，弃彼艺祖仁。\n昏荒事花石，艮岳排秋旻。\n师相宠京贯，狂妄开燕云。\n藩篱既已撤，狼虎俄成群。\n吞噬至骨肉，和议尚纷纭。\n父子徙沙漠，中原陷胡尘。\n至今窃愤录，一览犹伤神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18239,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古诗（六首。永乐五年） 其五","author":"高煦","text":"磊落元始祖，英名出天然。\n继统一海内，彬彬任才贤。\n偃武重斯文，生民皆息肩。\n从容颇中道，暗合如有传。\n胡俗思改易，华风未能全。\n文统与桑哥，相继专威权。\n兹诚损盛德，诛殛断弗怜。\n贻谋计亦疏，国运无百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18240,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古诗（六首。永乐五年） 其六","author":"高煦","text":"顺帝饶巧思，良工弗能及。\n奇后亵坤仪，储子骄相袭。\n奸回屡登崇，弊政滋郡邑。\n群雄遂蜂起，志士如龙螫。\n脱脱力未展，扩廓兵方集。\n信谗忌成功，九庙斯嶪岌。\n不有昏政乖，那归皇祖急。\n历数在圣明，万代洪基立。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18241,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴二首 其一","author":"高煦","text":"东风拆群植，淡荡吹芳辰。\n鸟鸣声已和，得气先于人。\n况我圣明父，奉天弘至仁。\n遂令六合里，万物皆生春。\n朝回坐斋阁，怡然乐吾真。\n诗章学古雅，琴调多清新。\n缅怀古哲王，宝贤安国民。\n予才虽未逮，有志当期伸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18242,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴二首 其二","author":"高煦","text":"疏泬带小雪，皎皎当前楹。\n暗香袭罗幕，诗怀浩然清。\n呵手写新句，异彼尘俗情。\n追咏古帝王，得失相与评。\n污青究心迹，丹铅分重轻。\n知我及罪我，愧彼春秋名。\n寒月照绮窗，囧囧为我明。\n整襟重自警，凛冽如怀冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18243,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀仙歌赐周玄初（永乐四年九月十九日。见周玄真《鹤林类集》）","author":"高煦","text":"我怀蓬岛之仙人，骖驾朱凤骑紫麟。\n瑶池清宴接谈笑，误落尘寰经几春。\n青童昨夜传书至，中有琅函洞章字。\n洞口桃花似旧时，门外孤松发新翠。\n椷书欲报碧云远，薜叶女萝若在眼。\n方平倘会蔡经家，为报扶桑水清浅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18244,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞天秋望赐周玄初","author":"高煦","text":"蓬莱宫阙涵清秋，羽客临风闲倚楼。\n海天一碧湛杯水，尘埃九野分中州。\n云里仙归鸣佩玉，紫凤琪园自栖宿。\n遥瞻西极半林青，知是瑶池桃未熟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18245,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词四首 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"屏掩春山夜渐长，秋来处处有新凉。\n一天明月星河澹，满殿风吹茉莉香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18246,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词四首 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"秋深凉气满楼台，落叶萧萧拥玉阶。\n清晓九门金锁掣，监宫先报进鹰来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18247,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词四首 其三","author":"周宪王","text":"劲翮凝霜画不成，马前多是内官擎。\n鹰坊下直人争问，谁贡河东白海青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18248,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词四首 其四","author":"周宪王","text":"三山冰合放鹰时，千骑如云授指麾。\n日暮六街尘滚滚，马前横抱白鹅归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18249,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绿腰琵琶（亦云\"六么琵琶\"）","author":"周宪王","text":"四面帘垂碧玉钩，重重深院锁春愁。\n绿腰舞困琵琶歇，花落东风懒下楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18250,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝二首 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"春来折尽更逢春，旧折长条又复新。\n谁有行人相送别，今年不是去年人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18251,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝二首 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"莫折柔丝五尺金，一丝丝系别离心。\n春风吹到无情处，乱滚香绵结昼阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18252,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝歌二首 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"春风满山花正开，春衫女儿红杏腮。\n侬家荡桨过江去，为问阿郎来不来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18253,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝歌二首 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"巴山后面竹鸡啼，巴水前头沙鸟栖。\n巴水巴山到郎处，闻郎又过石门溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18254,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝歌三首 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"苏小门前万缕垂，白家园内两三枝。\n听歌看舞人何在，惟有东风展翠眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18255,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝歌三首 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"三月风和散曲尘，枝枝垂地每伤神。\n为君系得春心住，忍折长条送远人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18256,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝歌三首 其三","author":"周宪王","text":"宛转千条罥晚风，拖烟带雨渭城东。\n征衫点得轻轻絮，寄入《阳关》曲调中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18257,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和白香山何处难忘酒六首 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"何处难忘酒，年光似掷梭。\n清明怜已过，春色苦无多。\n席上红牙板，花前皓齿歌。\n此时无一盏，争奈牡丹何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18258,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和白香山何处难忘酒六首 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"何处难忘酒，初秋暑尚存。\n双星渡银汉，微月照黄昏。\n瓜果排中閤，笙歌拂小轩。\n此时无一盏，何以待天孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18259,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和白香山何处难忘酒六首 其三","author":"周宪王","text":"何处难忘酒，遥登庾亮楼。\n歌声通上界，笑语在瀛洲。\n玉宇晴无际，冰轮夜不收。\n此时无一盏，何以玩中秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18260,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和白香山何处难忘酒六首 其四","author":"周宪王","text":"何处难忘酒，重阳戏马台。\n菰蒲随水落，橘柚待霜催。\n蟋蟀吟将老，茱萸插几回。\n此时无一盏，黄菊向谁开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18261,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和白香山何处难忘酒六首 其五","author":"周宪王","text":"何处难忘酒，寒窗一局棋。\n新篘开竹叶，老树发梅枝。\n拨火煨霜芋，围炉咏雪诗。\n此时无一盏，虚度小春时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18262,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和白香山何处难忘酒六首 其六","author":"周宪王","text":"何处难忘酒，深冬掩凤帏。\n管弦清晓发，猎骑夜深归。\n羊角旋风起，鹅毛大雪飞。\n此时无一盏，辜负黑貂衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18263,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟不如来饮酒八首 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"莫向忙中去，闲时自养神。\n功名一场梦，世界半分尘。\n日月朝还暮，时光秋复春。\n不如来饮酒，醉里乐天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18264,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟不如来饮酒八首 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"寄语红尘客，其如岁月何。\n新诗随意写，时曲放怀歌。\n老去朱颜改，年高白发多。\n不如来饮酒，看我舞婆娑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18265,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟不如来饮酒八首 其三","author":"周宪王","text":"攫攘何因尔，终朝傀儡牵。\n望尘忙趁市，满贯苦多钱。\n造物商岩板，羲和穆骏鞭。\n不如来饮酒，一醉大家眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18266,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟不如来饮酒八首 其四","author":"周宪王","text":"世态看来熟，浮生何苦忙。\n好花供老眼，佳茗刷枯肠。\n池上红鸳并，帘前紫燕翔。\n不如来饮酒，高卧北窗凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18267,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟不如来饮酒八首 其五","author":"周宪王","text":"故友成衰谢，新交未是俦。\n心劳悲幕燕，计拙笑巢鸠。\n莫作少年事，休将老态愁。\n不如来饮酒，赏玩菊花秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18268,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟不如来饮酒八首 其六","author":"周宪王","text":"莫入三街市，宜乘九夏凉。\n随缘得妙术，守分是仙乡。\n写字腾龙虎，吹箫引凤凰。\n不如来饮酒，烂醉锦筝傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18269,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟不如来饮酒八首 其七","author":"周宪王","text":"羡我霜髯老，逢时正太平。\n园畦频点检，书画悦心情。\n绿竹栽些个，红棋着一枰。\n不如来饮酒，且莫问输赢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18270,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟不如来饮酒八首 其八","author":"周宪王","text":"幸喜身康健，休论愚共贤。\n诗联有神助，老懒得天全。\n十日一风雨，三家百顷田。\n不如来饮酒，同乐好丰年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18271,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝谒皇陵","author":"周宪王","text":"万壑松风卷翠涛，花间晴露滴征袍。\n龙收夜雨归沧海，虎带春泥过石壕。\n千古衮旒藏玉匣，九重宫殿压金鳌。\n桥陵谒罢频回首，五色氤氲王气高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18272,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋蝉","author":"周宪王","text":"败柳疏林寄此生，凉时不似热时鸣。\n蜕形先觉金风动，轻翼偏嫌玉露清。\n抱叶常如经雨态，过枝犹带咽寒声。\n桑间此际螵蛸老，游息安闲莫漫惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18273,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋信","author":"周宪王","text":"飘飘梧叶委银床，天际初来雁几行。\n露气忽从今夜白，漏声偏觉五更长。\n惊幽梦矣书千里，有美人兮天一方。\n报道桂花成蓓蕾，雨余庭院喜新凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18274,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小亭即景","author":"周宪王","text":"小亭西畔画楼东，开遍阶前芍药丛。\n梅子雨干还有雨，楝花风过更无风。\n喜看池内鱼生子，惊退帘前燕逐虫。\n坐久忽闻黄鸟语，绿杨深处午阴中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18275,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆友丁大舍（国初勋爵之子未袭爵者皆称大舍，如古云舍人也）","author":"周宪王","text":"故人一别一年余，转眼光阴暑渐除。\n南徼万山常有梦，中原六月尚无书。\n窗前烛暗巴山雨，江上帆留楚水鱼。\n准拟重阳定相见，茱萸新酒候旋车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18276,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀","author":"周宪王","text":"楼阁凉生夜雨余，碧天如水雁来初。\n青山落日两行泪，锦树西风万里书。\n滇海相思情愈切，梁园行乐兴全疏。\n人还定把平安报，惟有霜华白满梳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18277,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云英诗","author":"周宪王","text":"云英何处访遗踪，空对阳台十二峰。\n花院无情金锁合，兰房有路碧苔封。\n消愁茶煮双团凤，萦恨香盘九篆龙。\n肠断端清楼阁里，墨痕烛灺尚重重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18278,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成二首 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"纮纮病骨觉清癯，心上清闲百事无。\n晓起灌园呼内竖，昼长临帖写官奴。\n宜人景物随时好，垂老风情得自娱。\n且进一樽花下酒，便拚微醉不须扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18279,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成二首 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"平生但乐迂疏趣，那得工夫计较愁。\n有酒便宜同客饮，无材何必为身谋。\n推窗玩《易》风生树，扫石焚香月满楼。\n手种西园好花竹，可人佳景足欢游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18280,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静坐","author":"周宪王","text":"静坐闲观理自明，是非荣辱岂须争。\n一身常在闲中过，万事肯于先处行。\n嫩竹半欹听夜雨，晚云收尽看秋晴。\n两般清意谁能识，世事交游物外情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18281,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芸阁初夏即事","author":"周宪王","text":"玉阶槐影绿阴阴，长日清闲罢抚琴。\n满架酴飐如散雪，一畦萱草似堆金。\n诗因中酒多随意，棋为饶人不用心。\n芸阁晚凉清兴发，兔毫新试写来禽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18282,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悟道吟二首 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"慈悲为雨法为航，心是莲华性是香。\n静里工夫些子力，闲中议论许多长。\n提携一气通金界，颠倒三车运玉浆。\n笑把明珠闲玩弄，眉间万丈白毫光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18283,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悟道吟二首 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"自从悟得真如理，今古空谈善有因。\n撒手往来还是我，点头问讯属何人。\n安闲常乐胜中胜，自在频观身外身。\n大笑西来缘底事，等闲识破便休论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18284,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"周宪王","text":"九十春光似转蓬，半晴天气雾溟蒙。\n一池新水今朝雨，满地残花昨夜风。\n白发自怜诗兴在，红颜莫放酒樽空。\n闲看青简思今古，得失由来一梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18285,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送雪","author":"周宪王","text":"天山一色冻云垂，罨画楼台缀玉时。\n准备暖金香盒子，明朝送雪与相知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18286,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临安即事","author":"周宪王","text":"冻雨寒烟满戍城，雨中烟外更伤情。\n沙头风静鸳鸯睡，岭上云深孔雀鸣。\n番域白盐从海出，野田青蔗绕篱生。\n蛮方异俗那堪语，独立高台泪似倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18287,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老人灯","author":"周宪王","text":"百岁身躯浪得名，提携何苦自劳形。\n年来偏觉心肠热，老去只余脏腑明。\n半夜风中常懊恨，一生线上作经营。\n可怜亦被风光引，摆手摇头学后生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18288,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春久阴寒风雨","author":"周宪王","text":"蝶怨蜂愁静小园，阴寒已过勒花天。\n雨中狼藉榆钱少，风里飘扬柳絮颠。\n堪笑一春惟饮酒，自怜三月尚衣绵。\n海棠开尽蔷薇老，孤负芳辰又一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18289,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登城有怀","author":"周宪王","text":"一上高城思渺冥，情怀如梦复如醒。\n长河浊浪从来急，嵩岳高峰分外青。\n樵径远萦芳草岸，渔舟闲傍夕阳汀。\n登临感慨斜阳外，望尽长亭复短亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18290,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋凉","author":"周宪王","text":"苍凉初日照帘栊，秋气清高八月中。\n满砌寒蛩啼冷露，一天新雁度西风。\n病怀得酒如春暖，老眼看花似叶红。\n独坐小轩无个事，闷来聊复理丝桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18291,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宫词（一百三首） 其一","author":"周宪王","text":"大安楼阁耸云霄，列坐三宫御早朝。\n政是太平无事日，九重深处奏箫《韶》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18292,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宫词（一百三首） 其二","author":"周宪王","text":"春日融和上翠台，芳池九曲似流杯。\n合香殿外花如锦，不是看花不敢来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18293,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宫词（一百三首） 其三","author":"周宪王","text":"棕殿巍巍西内中，御筵箫鼓奏薰风。\n诸王驸马咸称寿，满酌葡萄饮玉钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18294,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宫词（一百三首） 其四","author":"周宪王","text":"雨顺风调四海宁，丹墀大乐列优伶。\n年年正旦将朝会，殿内先观玉海青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18295,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宫词（一百三首） 其五","author":"周宪王","text":"东风吹绽牡丹芽，漠漠轻阴护碧纱。\n向晓内园春色重，满栏清露湿桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18296,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宫词（一百三首） 其六","author":"周宪王","text":"上都四月衣金纱，避暑随銮即是家。\n纳钵北来天气冷，只宜栽种牡丹花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18297,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宫词（一百三首） 其七","author":"周宪王","text":"合香殿倚翠峰头，太液波澄暑雨收。\n两岸垂杨千百尺，荷花深处戏龙舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":18298,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]